### SalesService — sample requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run `cds watch` first.
@host = http://localhost:4004

### ---------- READ (CRUD: Read) ----------

### List all sales orders with their items expanded
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders?$expand=items,customer

### Read a single order
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)

### List all products
GET {{host}}/sales/Products

### Filter: confirmed orders only
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders?$filter=status eq 'CONFIRMED'

### ---------- CREATE ----------

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/sales/Customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wayne Enterprises",
  "email": "bruce@wayne.com",
  "country": "USA",
  "city": "Gotham"
}

### Create a (header-only) sales order
POST {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_ID": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "note": "Created via REST"
}

### ---------- UPDATE ----------

### Patch an order's note
PATCH {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Updated note text"
}

### ---------- DELETE ----------

### Delete an order item
DELETE {{host}}/sales/OrderItems(77777777-0001-0001-0001-000000000002)

### ---------- BOUND ACTIONS ----------

### Confirm an order
POST {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)/SalesService.confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Cancel an order with a reason
POST {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)/SalesService.cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Customer requested cancellation" }

### Add an item to an order
POST {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0002-0002-0002-000000000002)/SalesService.addItem
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product_ID": "dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd", "quantity": 3 }

### ---------- BOUND FUNCTION ----------

### Get order summary
GET {{host}}/sales/SalesOrders(99999999-0001-0001-0001-000000000001)/SalesService.getSummary()

### ---------- UNBOUND ACTION ----------

### Create a full order (header + items) in one call
POST {{host}}/sales/createOrder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "note": "Bulk order via unbound action",
  "items": [
    { "product": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "quantity": 5 },
    { "product": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### ---------- UNBOUND FUNCTIONS ----------

### Revenue grouped by status
GET {{host}}/sales/getRevenueByStatus()

### Low-stock products (threshold = 10)
GET {{host}}/sales/getLowStockProducts(threshold=10)
